%% Infinity-Context v1.2.0 candidate; behavior differs by native adapter.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Agent as Host agent
  participant Adapter as icx-adapters / MMU
  participant CAS as Redactor + BLAKE3 CAS / DAG
  participant Index as Exact postings + HDC / fractal / PPR
  participant Bus as File-backed bus
  participant Store as SQLite store
  Agent->>Adapter: Supported hook payload or canonical icx request
  Adapter->>Adapter: Validate envelope, capability and arguments
  Adapter->>CAS: Redact before hashing and persistence
  CAS-->>Adapter: Recoverable artifact handle (exact post-redaction bytes)
  Adapter->>Index: Index artifact; lexical coverage precedes similarity score
  Adapter->>Bus: Publish bounded event (positioned I/O + writer lock)
  Adapter->>Store: Persist successful daemon request state
  Store-->>Adapter: Commit result (WAL synchronous=FULL)
  alt Persistence fails
    Adapter-->>Agent: Error response; daemon exits with error
  else Persistence succeeds
    alt Claude supported replacement
      Adapter-->>Agent: Native replacement envelope
    else Codex PostToolUse
      Adapter-->>Agent: Non-replacing envelope; original output remains visible
    else Other supported adapter operation
      Adapter-->>Agent: Adapter-specific response
    end
  end
  Agent->>Adapter: Next supported context assembly
  Adapter->>Bus: Read pending events with expected sequence checks
  Adapter->>Adapter: Select whole frames within conservative UTF-8 byte budget
  Adapter-->>Agent: Managed window / structured tail; unsent events remain pending
